            "id": 11,
            "module": "deepseek-ai:createAChatCompletion",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {
                "__IMTCONN__": 3934750
            },
            "mapper": {
                "messages": [
                    {
                        "role": "user",
                        "content": "Based on this summary, respond only with one of two responses:  \n\nNo response needed  \nResponse needed  \n\n**Criteria for tagging:**  \n\n- **No response needed**  \n  - Marketing, promotional, newsletters, system-generated emails, solicitations, meeting invites, general updates, or automated notifications.  \n  - Examples include newsletters, reminders, and generic business insights.  \n\n- **Response needed**  \n  - The email directly mentions **Mark, Prompt Advisers, or an existing project, proposal, or relevant communication** requiring attention.  \n  - Includes discussions, follow-ups, inquiries, or project-related details.  \n\nThis is the email content:  \n\n{{2.subject}}  \n{{2.text}}  \n{{2.from.name}}  \n{{2.from.address}}  "
                    }
                ],
                "model": "deepseek-reasoner",
                "max_tokens": "4096",
                "temperature": "1",
                "response_format": {
                    "type": "text"
                },
                "top_p": "1"
            },
            "metadata": {
